      "page": 1,
      "body": "HI all, I am doing research into strollers/prams. What are your opinions on the best one/s for HK. I travel by foot and MTR mail, but do use taxi's every now and then.\n\nFrom what I've gathered so far, I am looking for something that has good manoeuvrability, lightweight, easy to fold (one hand), storage space, seat can be used as bassinet.\n\nI'm not fussed by brands or being 'up-to-date' with trends and happy with good second hand one too.\n\nThanks in advance",
